ulls/116768","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116768","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116768.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116768.patch","merged_at":"2026-02-26T14:20:55Z"},"body":"I'm sure I could find many more things to change, but I've had some of these lying around in a branch for months now, waiting for more of these minor changes to pile up, and now seems like a good time to push them.\r\n\r\nThe changes are as follows:\r\n\r\n1. Moved `JoltObject3D::shapes` into `JoltShapedObject3D` instead, since it had no business being there, so just added 16 bytes to every `JoltSoftBody3D` for no reason.\r\n2. Have the creation of `JPH::EmptyShape` just use the constructor rather than going the roundabout way of `JPH::EmptyShapeSettings(...).Create().Get()`.\r\n3. Moved the recently moved `SetBodyActivationListener` calls from `JoltSpace3D::step` into `JoltSpace3D::_pre_step` and `JoltSpace3D::_post_step`, where they arguably belong.\r\n4. Changed `JoltContactListener3D::area_soft_body_overlaps` to be a `LocalVector` instead of a `HashSet`, since we have no need for the deduplication, sorting or lookup that `HashSet` would offer.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/eve